    "scope_description": {
      "value": "Renovation and alteration of Indoor Firing Range #2 (Room 134) at the CBP Advanced Training Center. Scope includes structural support (steel angles for baffle ceiling system), architectural work (replace ceiling baffles with horizontal ballistic steel plate ceiling matching Range #3, replace wall Tectum acoustical panels, repair projectile damage to floor slab and concrete wall panels), electrical work (replace lighting fixtures and target system), and HVAC system (coordinated with Range Ventilation Design, Inc.).",
      "source": "BOD p.1 General",
      "quote": "This project consists of providing structural, architectural, and electrical support for the new lighting fixtures, baffle ceiling system, HVAC system, and target system (by Action Target) in Indoor Firing Range #2 (Room 134) in the Advanced Training Center Firing Range in Harpers Ferry, West Virginia.",
      "corroboration": [
        {
          "source": "BOD p.1",
          "claim": "structural, architectural, and electrical support for the new lighting fixtures, baffle ceiling system, HVAC system, and target system (by Action Target) in Indoor Firing Range #2 (Room 134)",
